===New Zealand vs Slovakia===
This was New Zealand's first World Cup game since their debut in the [[1982 FIFA World Cup|1982]] tournament, where they lost all three of their group games.<ref name="BBCNzSl">{{Cite web |website=BBC News |last=Cheese |first=Caroline |date=2010 |title=New Zealand 1-1 Slovakia |url=http://news.bbc.co.uk/sport2/hi/football/world_cup_2010/matches/match_12/default.stm}}</ref>

Slovakia went ahead early in the second half via striker [[Róbert Vittek]]. New Zealand struggled to create any clear cut chances of their own, however deep into stoppage time [[Winston Reid]] equalized for New Zealand via a header. The 1-1 draw was New Zealand's first ever point at the FIFA World Cup finals.<ref name="BBCNzSl"/>
