===Paraguay vs New Zealand===
Paraguay qualified for the round of 16 for the fourth time in their history after being held to a 0–0 draw by New Zealand.<ref >{{Cite web |website=The Guardian |date=25 June 2010 |title=World Cup 2010: Paraguay through after drab draw with New Zealand |url=https://www.theguardian.com/football/2010/jun/24/paraguay-new-zealand-world-cup-match-report}}</ref>

With their third successive draw, New Zealand concluded their campaign undefeated above World Cup holders Italy, but failed to qualify for the round of 16 by a single point.<ref >{{Cite web |website=BBC Sport|last=Chowdhury |first=Saj |date=2010 |title=Paraguay 0-0 New Zealand |url=http://news.bbc.co.uk/sport2/hi/football/world_cup_2010/matches/match_42/default.stm}}</ref>
